  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育—墊上核心",
    "sub_ename": "MAT SCIENCE",
    "describe_ch": "「墊上核心訓練」MAT SCIENCE結合瑜珈、運動調節、復健、舞蹈等精髓，是一套可以提供體適能指導者設計運動處方的新選擇。「墊上核心」訓練重點是「集中呼吸」與「意識動作」，可提高全身肌肉的強化、柔軟度與平衡，將重點置於身體軀幹，以培養身體安定的力量，使用組合的方式活動身體，對於改善姿勢、調整體線有相當大的幫助，以期增進健康，而且可以依照參與者不同的體適能狀態進行課程的調整。",
    "describe_eh": "MAT SCIENCE combines the essence of yoga, movement regulation, rehabilitation, dance and so on, is a set of physical fitness can provide guidance to design a new choice of exercise prescription. The focus is on \"Concentration of Breathing\" and \"Consciousness Movement\", which can enhance the strengthening, softness and balance of the whole body muscles. The focus will be placed on the torso of the body to cultivate the strength of the body and use the combined way to move the body. For the improvement of posture, adjust the body line has a considerable help to improve health, but also in accordance with the participants in different physical fitness state of the course adjustment.",
    "pre_subname": "",
